-reversal guarantees reduce purchase anxiety and consistently lift conversion rates, especially for first-time buyers.\", \"Hash\": \"guarantee-05\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a sticky bottom CTA bar showing price and a persistent 'Get Your Copy' button.\", \"Why\": \"Keeps the purchase action always visible as users scroll, increasing CTA clicks particularly on mobile where scrolling is heavy.\", \"Hash\": \"sticky-cta-06\"}, {\"What\": \"Added an FAQ section addressing common objections (reading order, age range, delivery, refunds).\", \"Why\": \"Proactively answering objections at the point of decision removes friction and reduces cart abandonment.\", \"Hash\": \"faq-07\"}, {\"What\": \"Added SEO meta title, description, semantic HTML, descriptive alt text, and mobile-responsive design with fast, dependency-free inline CSS.\", \"Why\": \"Better SEO drives more qualified organic traffic, and mobile-optimized fast-loading pages convert significantly better since the majority of traffic is mobile.\", \"Hash\": \"seo-mobile-08\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"The user didn't provide any HTML to improve, so I'll need to create a complete landing page for \"The Marvelous Land of Oz\" from scratch, designing it with conversion optimization in mind and highlighting the key improvements I'm making.","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"The user didn't provide any HTML to improve, so I'll need to create a complete landing page for \"The Marvelous Land of Oz\" from scratch, designing it with conversion optimization in mind and highlighting the key improvements I'm making.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":470,"completion_tokens":6624,"total_tokens":7094,"cost":0.3359,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.3359,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.0047,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.3